JSONTestSuite
=============

The .json files in this directory are the test_parsing corpus of

    https://github.com/nst/JSONTestSuite
    commit 1ef36fa01286573e846ac449e8683f8833c5b26a (2024-11-22)

copyright (c) 2016 Nicolas Seriot and distributed under the MIT license, see
the file LICENSE next to this one.

Following the upstream convention, a file whose name starts with `y_` must be
accepted, one starting with `n_` must be rejected, and one starting with `i_`
may go either way.

tst/test_jsontestsuite.tst runs the corpus through the package and compares the
outcome against the table in tst/jsontestsuite.g.
